{"title":"Duke Pendragon","synopsis":"Terlahir sebagai penerus keluarga bangsawan berpangkat rendah Raven Varte menanggung dosa keluarganya yang diduga merencanakan pemberontakan melawan kekaisaran Sebagai pengampunan dia dikirim untuk melawan Demon bersama Satuan terburuk kekaisaran Satuan Demon Sebagian besar mengatakan bahwa itu adalah tempat di mana orangorang tidak akan bertahan bahkan selama satu tahun tetapi Raven entah bagaimana berhasil bertahan selama sepuluh tahun Ketika pengampunanya berada di depan mata di medan perang terakhirnya dia bertemu dengan Penerus Keluarga Duke Pendragon Eren Pendragon","alternative_title":"White Dragon Duke: Pendragon, 백룡공작 팬드래건","author":"Kim Hyungjun, Utsumi Yuusuke","artist":"Sumishiro Yukina","genres":["Action","Adventure","Demon","Drama","Fantasy","Magic"],"chapters":[{"id":"57a5ef08-99a4-4ae3-971e-b81e9d224668","number":"131","title":"Chapter 131","date":"2025-04-13","images":[]},{"id":"186472b7-ad55-4a2c-9c0f-e4d29d332433","number":"130","title":"Chapter 130","date":"2025-04-10","images":[]},{"id":"fc5b68c0-ee6b-4d8a-8ea4-daab8dfe1945","number":"129","title":"Chapter 129","date":"2025-03-30","images":[]},{"id":"698ff8f3-3ba5-46b6-a724-4143e5b5f907","number":"128","title":"Chapter 128","date":"2025-03-21","images":[]},{"id":"343bb851-baa7-4533-b29c-5c13917874e0","number":"127","title":"Chapter 127","date":"2025-03-19","images":[]},{"id":"d0e52fc7-62e5-4cc9-8c64-f08e1c9d0783","number":"126","title":"Chapter 126","date":"2025-03-09","images":[]},{"id":"40900363-a0d9-4cc2-9c48-9b7f484904e1","number":"125","title":"Chapter 125","date":"2025-03-02","images":[]},{"id":"17d9cd6a-5366-4511-bd3a-cd2f2d8241d8","number":"124","title":"Chapter 124","date":"2025-03-02","images":[]},{"id":"f1547660-1531-438c-95d8-51c8cafcd0df","number":"123","title":"Chapter 123","date":"2025-03-02","images":[]},{"id":"51e66435-41aa-4804-a2c9-6fa1305dd189","number":"122","title":"Chapter 122","date":"2025-03-02","images":[]},{"id":"ecbfe7a3-1aeb-4481